<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25184" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαλῡμαίνομαι</span></b> , aor. 1
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διελυμηνάμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					1515
				</span></i>
			:—<i>maltreat shamefully,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					9.112
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑλλάδα δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
				</span></i>
			 l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵμερός με δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					59
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>cheat grossly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τινὰ ταῖς κοτύλαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					436
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>falsify, corrupt,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ νόμισμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Th.</u>
					348
				</span></i>
			; of poetry, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				1062
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>ruin, spoil,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ πολλὰ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					24
				</span></i>
			: c.dat., <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				2.54b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				7.20.5
			</span></i>: pf.
			part.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαλελυμασμένος</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.112
			</span></i>: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διελυμάνθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					1349
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.).</div>
